      ],
      "text": "The app consists of Swift sources (AppDelegate, ServerManager, SettingsView, AuthStatus) plus a bundled cli-proxy-api-plus binary, config.yaml, and icon resources inside the .app."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_67cff387cb084f210552ee6a206d247a3144b2988d37b028466c44fe9bc452ea",
