        "slc_bc21d382bc9c082307f4474be109a00da004a45978a480b9fe80bf964b7177b2"
      ],
      "text": "VibeProxy supports a custom model-name suffix pattern {model}-thinking-{NUMBER} that it intercepts, strips, and converts into a thinking token-budget parameter before forwarding to CLIProxyAPI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_05ead5e303fe0aa6818c350e3777463310d17849d8da645773f831ec8cc6d9d1",
